      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="world" value="&lt;b&gt;World.umap · 퍼시스턴트 단일 월드&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6a6a6a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;퍼시스턴트 레벨 + 서브레벨 스트리밍. travel 없음 — 모든 이동이 좌표 이동.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#1a1a1a;strokeWidth=1.6;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="320" y="44" width="656" height="512" as="geometry" />
